msgid "ReliefPPT"
msgstr "ReliefPPT"

msgid ""
"ReliefPPT 是 ReliefOS 内置的 C++ / FLTK 演示文稿编辑器。界面沿用系统原生控件和主题，支持中文显示、Xorg 输入法和 "
"UTF-8 剪贴板。通过应用菜单启动，或运行 ``reliefppt [演示文稿.rppt]``；Fileman 可直接打开 ``.rppt`` 文件。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefPPT is ReliefOS's built-in C++ / FLTK presentation editor. Its "
"interface retains native system widgets and themes, with Chinese display, "
"Xorg input methods, and UTF-8 clipboard support. Launch it from the "
"applications menu or run ``reliefppt [演示文稿.rppt]``; Fileman can open "
"``.rppt`` files directly."

msgid "开始制作"
msgstr "Getting Started"

msgid ""
"左侧选择幻灯片，中间编辑内容，顶部通过“开始、插入、设计、放映”切换工具。文件菜单提供新建、打开、保存、导出及三页示例。常用操作也提供工具提示。"
msgstr ""
"Select slides on the left, edit in the center, and switch tools through "
"Home, Insert, Design, and Slide Show at the top. The File menu provides New,"
" Open, Save, Export, and a three-slide example. Common operations also have "
"tooltips."

msgid ""
"在“开始”选择版式，再点“新建幻灯片”。支持空白、标题、标题和内容、两栏内容；也可以复制、删除或在“设计”中上下移动整张幻灯片。最后一张删除后保留一张空白页。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a layout in Home, then click New Slide. Layouts include Blank, Title,"
" Title and Content, and Two Content Columns. Duplicate or delete slides, or "
"move whole slides up/down in Design. Deleting the last slide leaves one "
"blank slide."

msgid ""
"插入文本框、图片、矩形、椭圆、直线或箭头。单击选择，按住 Shift 单击多选；拖动对象移动，拖动八个控制点缩放，按住 Shift "
"保持宽高比。方向键微调，Shift 配合方向键每次移动 10 单位。"
msgstr ""
"Insert text boxes, images, rectangles, ellipses, lines, or arrows. Click to "
"select and Shift-click for multiple selection. Drag objects to move, or the "
"eight handles to resize; hold Shift to preserve aspect ratio. Arrow keys "
"nudge; Shift+arrow moves 10 units at a time."

msgid ""
"双击文本框或按 F2 / Enter 编辑，Esc "
"完成编辑。字体、字号、粗体、斜体、下划线、文字颜色、对齐和项目符号作用于整个文本框。文字自动换行；超出边界的部分裁剪，属性对话框提示增大文本框或减小字号。"
msgstr ""
"Double-click a text box or press F2 / Enter to edit; Esc finishes. Font, "
"size, bold, italic, underline, text color, alignment, and bullets apply to "
"the whole text box. Text wraps automatically and clips beyond its bounds; "
"the Properties dialog suggests enlarging the box or reducing font size."

msgid ""
"“位置与大小”可以精确调整几何、边框和填充。“插入”还提供多对象对齐和图层顺序。“设计”可选择 16:9 / "
"4:3、当前页配色、背景和网格；吸附移动时按住 Alt 可临时取消吸附。"
msgstr ""
"Position and Size precisely adjusts geometry, borders, and fill. Insert also"
" offers multi-object alignment and layer order. Design chooses 16:9 / 4:3, "
"current-slide colors, background, and grid; hold Alt while moving with "
"snapping to temporarily disable it."

msgid "“放映”可调整缩放、适应窗口或打开演讲备注。备注随原生文档保存，不进入放映、PNG 和 HTML。"
msgstr ""
"Slide Show provides zoom, Fit to Window, and speaker notes. Notes are saved "
"in native documents but excluded from slide shows, PNG, and HTML."

msgid ""
"图片支持 PNG 和未压缩的 24/32 位 BMP，插入时嵌入 RGBA 数据，之后移动或删除源图片不影响演示。PNG 保留透明度；BI_RGB "
"BMP 的保留 alpha 通道按不透明处理。直线和箭头为水平线段，箭头指向右侧；首版没有旋转、对象组合或斜线端点编辑。"
msgstr ""
"Images support PNG and uncompressed 24/32-bit BMP, embedding RGBA data on "
"insertion so later moving or deleting the source does not affect the "
"presentation. PNG retains transparency; reserved alpha in BI_RGB BMP is "
"treated as opaque. Lines and arrows are horizontal segments, with arrows "
"pointing right. The first version has no rotation, grouping, or diagonal "
"endpoint editing."

msgid "保存、分享与恢复"
msgstr "Saving, Sharing, and Recovery"

msgid ""
"``.rppt`` 是可继续编辑的原生格式，保存幻灯片、对象、图层、样式、背景、备注和图片。首版不读写 Microsoft PPT / "
"PPTX。保存采用同目录临时文件及原子替换；检测到文件被其他程序修改时，会提示另存副本或明确替换。该检测为乐观检查，不能排除其他写者在最后检查后立即修改文件。提交后同步失败会尝试回滚；如果磁盘同时拒绝回滚，会明确报错并提示保留下来的旧文件备份位置。"
msgstr ""
"``.rppt`` is the editable native format, preserving slides, objects, layers,"
" styles, backgrounds, notes, and images. The first version does not read or "
"write Microsoft PPT / PPTX. Saving uses same-directory temporary files and "
"atomic replacement. External modification prompts for saving a copy or "
"explicit replacement. This is an optimistic check and cannot exclude another"
" writer changing the file immediately after the final check. Sync failure "
"after commit triggers an attempted rollback; if the disk also refuses "
"rollback, an explicit error identifies the retained old-file backup "
"location."

msgid ""
"PNG 导出当前幻灯片，尺寸与幻灯片单位一致，默认宽屏为 960 × 540。HTML 导出整个演示，每页为内嵌 "
"PNG，带浏览器键盘导航和全屏按钮，可离线打开；这是分享格式，不能重新导入编辑，也不包含备注。导出保留当前编辑文档，并防止覆盖已打开的原生文件。"
msgstr ""
"PNG exports the current slide at dimensions matching slide units; default "
"widescreen is 960 × 540. HTML exports the entire presentation as embedded "
"PNG pages, with browser keyboard navigation and a full-screen button, usable"
" offline. It is a sharing format, cannot be reimported for editing, and "
"omits notes. Export preserves the current editing document and prevents "
"overwriting an open native file."

msgid ""
"有未保存修改时每 60 秒保存恢复副本，包括尚未退出文本框或备注输入框的内容。副本位于 "
"``$XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefppt/recovery``，未设置时使用 "
"``$HOME/.local/state/reliefppt/recovery``。正常保存或明确丢弃会清理本窗口的副本；意外结束后再次启动可选择恢复为新文件。恢复时优先使用最新的有效副本，跳过损坏或仍被其他实例占用的文件；恢复后继续编辑时，仅在下一份自动保存成功后清理上一代副本。同一时间运行的窗口通过锁避免抢占对方副本。"
msgstr ""
"Unsaved changes produce a recovery copy every 60 seconds, including text not"
" yet committed by leaving a text box or notes input. Copies reside in "
"``$XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefppt/recovery``, or "
"``$HOME/.local/state/reliefppt/recovery`` if unset. Normal saving or "
"explicit discard clears this window's copy. After unexpected exit, the next "
"launch offers recovery as a new file. Recovery prefers the newest valid copy"
" and skips damaged files or those used by other instances. When editing "
"after recovery, the previous generation is removed only after the next "
"autosave succeeds. Concurrent windows use locks to avoid taking each other's"
" copies."

msgid "快捷键"
msgstr "Keyboard Shortcuts"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O; 操作：新建 / 打开"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O; Action: New / Open"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+S / Ctrl+Shift+S; 操作：保存 / 另存为"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+S / Ctrl+Shift+S; Action: Save / Save As"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y、Ctrl+Shift+Z; 操作：撤销 / 重做"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+Shift+Z; Action: Undo / Redo"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+C / Ctrl+X / Ctrl+V; 操作：复制 / 剪切 / 粘贴对象或文字"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Ctrl+C / Ctrl+X / Ctrl+V; Action: Copy / Cut / Paste Objects or "
"Text"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+A / Ctrl+D; 操作：全选对象 / 创建对象副本"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Ctrl+A / Ctrl+D; Action: Select All Objects / Duplicate Objects"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+M; 操作：按所选版式新建幻灯片"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+M; Action: New Slide with Selected Layout"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+B / Ctrl+I / Ctrl+U; 操作：整个文本框的粗体 / 斜体 / 下划线"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Ctrl+B / Ctrl+I / Ctrl+U; Action: Bold / Italic / Underline for "
"the Entire Text Box"

msgid "快捷键：F2、Enter / Esc; 操作：编辑所选文本框 / 完成编辑"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: F2, Enter / Esc; Action: Edit Selected Text Box / Finish Editing"

msgid "快捷键：Delete; 操作：删除所选对象"
msgstr "Shortcut: Delete; Action: Delete Selected Objects"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+鼠标滚轮; 操作：调整画布缩放"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+Mouse Wheel; Action: Adjust Canvas Zoom"

msgid "快捷键：F5 / Shift+F5; 操作：从头放映 / 从当前页放映"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: F5 / Shift+F5; Action: Slide Show from Start / Current Slide"

msgid "快捷键：放映中方向键、PageUp / PageDown、空格; 操作：切换幻灯片"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Arrow Keys, PageUp / PageDown, Space During Slide Show; Action: "
"Change Slides"

msgid "快捷键：放映中 Home / End、B、Esc; 操作：首张 / 末张、黑屏、返回编辑"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Home / End, B, Esc During Slide Show; Action: First / Last Slide, "
"Black Screen, Return to Editor"

msgid "输入框获得焦点时，选择、剪贴板和文字撤销遵循 FLTK 输入控件的行为。"
msgstr ""
"When an input field has focus, selection, clipboard, and text undo follow "
"FLTK input-widget behavior."

msgid "资源范围"
msgstr "Resource Limits"

msgid ""
"上限为 500 张幻灯片、每页 256 个对象、总计 20,000 个对象、256 张内嵌图片。单张图片最大 4096 × 4096，全部 RGBA "
"最多 64 MiB；每个文本框最多 32 KiB UTF-8，单页备注最多 64 KiB；原生文件最大 96 MiB。文字字号 6–144 磅，页面尺寸"
" 240–4000 单位；对象必须完整位于页面内。"
msgstr ""
"Limits are 500 slides, 256 objects per slide, 20,000 objects total, and 256 "
"embedded images. Each image is at most 4096 × 4096, with at most 64 MiB of "
"RGBA data in total. Each text box allows 32 KiB UTF-8, notes 64 KiB per "
"slide, and native files 96 MiB. Font sizes range 6–144 pt and page "
"dimensions 240–4000 units; objects must fit entirely inside the page."

msgid ""
"撤销最多保留 64 个状态，元数据预算 64 "
"MiB；不可变图片像素在状态之间共享，删除图片或幻灯片会回收当前文档不再使用的图片槽位。文本换行保护常见中文、组合字符和 emoji 序列，不是完整 "
"Unicode grapheme-break 实现。首版没有音视频、动画、表格、图表、打印或 PDF 导出。"
msgstr ""
"Undo retains at most 64 states with a 64 MiB metadata budget. Immutable "
"image pixels are shared across states; deleting images or slides reclaims "
"image slots no longer used by the current document. Text wrapping protects "
"common Chinese, combining-character, and emoji sequences, but is not a full "
"Unicode grapheme-break implementation. The first version has no audio/video,"
" animations, tables, charts, printing, or PDF export."
